      "writtenOn": "2025-06-30T17:35:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s necessary, the main problem would be trying to match changes to the unparsedCertificates list with the changes in bundle.der. If there was a mismatch between the PEM and the DER it\u0027d be quite hard to pinpoint without significant extra effort from a reviewer.\n\nI don\u0027t think we really need to worry about adversarial changes here, since we only accept the automated updates from our release tooling, so I think it\u0027s just fine to trust the generated bundle file, as long as the relevant tests pass. Maybe we should add a test to fallback_test.go that checks that the certs returned by mustParse have their CN matching the CN in unparsedCertificates?",
      "parentUuid": "63be9e45_3e22e61c",
